# Subject 03c — CI toolchain install fix (G-33)
#
# Real Actions runs only, per rfcs/handoffs/03c-ci-toolchain-install.md:
# "Do not verify by reading the YAML." See baseline-03c.log for the
# pre-fix failure this subject closes.

## The fix

.github/workflows/ci.yml:42, "check" job, "Install Rust 1.91 toolchain"
step:

    - rustup toolchain install 1.91 --profile minimal --component rustfmt clippy
    + rustup toolchain install 1.91 --profile minimal --component rustfmt,clippy

`rustup toolchain install` takes one `--component` flag with a
comma-separated list; the space-separated form parses `clippy` as a
second positional TOOLCHAIN argument, which is not a valid toolchain
name. Comma-separated is correct.

